- dart lint
+ dart format
- dart style
- dart pretty
> `dart format` applies the official Dart formatting rules.
? mcq: What is pub.dev?
- The Dart compiler
+ The public repository of Dart and Flutter packages
- An online Dart IDE
- A testing framework
> pub.dev hosts packages that pub can download into your project.
