? scenario: Your widget tree contains `SizedBox(height: 16)` in many places. What simple change can help Flutter skip unnecessary work?
+ Make it `const SizedBox(height: 16)`
- Wrap it in a StatefulWidget
- Replace it with a Container
- Mark it late
> const widgets are canonicalised and do not need to be rebuilt.
? mcq: What happens when you call `add` on a const list at runtime?
